### Listar pontos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitoring-points?page=0&size=20

### Filtrar pontos por bairro
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitoring-points?neighborhood=Bela%20Vista&active=true

### Consultar ponto demonstrativo 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitoring-points/1

### Criar ponto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitoring-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ponto de teste da equipe",
  "street": "Rua de teste",
  "neighborhood": "Centro",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "latitude": -23.5505,
  "longitude": -46.6333,
  "active": true
}

### Listar ocorrências
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/flood-occurrences?page=0&size=20

### Filtrar ocorrências
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/flood-occurrences?status=REPORTED&neighborhood=Bela%20Vista

### Registrar ocorrência (ponto 1 criado pela migration V2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/flood-occurrences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monitoringPointId": 1,
  "description": "Exemplo acadêmico de acúmulo de água na via.",
  "severity": "MEDIUM",
  "source": "DEMONSTRATION",
  "occurredAt": "2026-11-05T12:00:00-03:00"
}

### Atualizar status: substitua 1 pelo id retornado no POST
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/flood-occurrences/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}
